cking Services\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"314e143\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p style=\\\"text-align:center; color:#64748B; font-size:16px; max-width:720px; margin:8px auto 10px;\\\">Our flagship live production system at <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/dts-logistics.tech\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\" style=\\\"color:#F97316; font-weight:700; text-decoration:underline;\\\">dts-logistics.tech<\\/a> \\u2014 designed, analyzed, programmed, and documented by Team Teampura for <strong>Dennis Trucking Services (Igpit, Opol)<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"03b6954\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"_element_id\":\"projects-grid-row\",\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"flex_wrap\":\"wrap\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"2885f16\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"d9f4892\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<div class=\\\"tp-project-card-inner\\\"><div class=\\\"tp-project-thumb-wrap\\\"><img class=\\\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-120\\\" src=\\\"http:\\/\\/professional-portfolio.test\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/11\\/TRACK-300x143.png\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"300\\\" height=\\\"143\\\" \\/><img src=\\\"http:\\/\\/professional-portfolio.test\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/11\\/dts-logistics-preview.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Dennis Trucking Services Live Preview\\\" \\/><span class=\\\"tp-live-domain-pill\\\"> LIVE \\u2022 DTS-LOGISTICS.TECH<\\/span><\\/div><p><span class=\\\"member-badge-tag\\\" style=\\\"align-self: flex-start; margin-bottom: 8px;\\\">FLAGSHIP LIVE SYSTEM<\\/span><\\/p><h3 style=\\\"color: #0f172a; font-size: 1.14rem; font-weight: bold; margin: 4px 0 8px;\\\">DTS Real-Time GPS Cargo &amp; Waybill Tracker<\\/h3><p style=\\\"color: #64748b; font-size: 13.8px; line-height: 1.62; margin: 0;\\\">Production freight platform for Dennis Trucking Services (Igpit, Opol) with Mapbox live GPS fleet tracking, waybill number lookup (e.g. DTS-882104), and Digital Photo e-POD.<\\/p><ul class=\\\"tp-check-list\\\"><li><i class=\\\"fa-solid fa-circle-check\\\"><\\/i>Live GPS truck location &amp; speed telemetry<\\/li><li><i class=\\\"fa-solid fa-circle-check\\\"><\\/i>Waybill tracking &amp; digital photo proof (e-POD)<\\/li><\\/ul><div class=\\\"tp-skill-row\\\" style=\\\"justify-content: flex-start; margin-top: 10px;\\\"><span class=\\\"tp-skill-chip\\\">Laravel<\\/span><span class=\\\"tp-skill-chip\\\">React \\/ Inertia<\\/span><span class=\\\"tp-skill-chip\\\">Mapbox GPS<\\/span><span class=\\\"tp-skill-chip\\\">MySQL<\\/span><\\/div><div class=\\\"tp-project-visit-btn\\\"><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/dts-logistics.tech\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">Open Live System (dts-logistics.tech) <i class=\\\"fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square\\\"><\\/i><\\/a><\\/div><\\/div>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"cb8912b\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"2c927f3\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<div class=\\\"tp-project-card-inner\\\"><div class=\\\"tp-project-thumb-wrap\\\"><img class=\\\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-121\\\" src=\\\"http:\\/\\/professional-portfolio.test\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/11\\/ROUTES-300x143.png\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"300\\\" height=\\\"143\\\" \\/><span class=\\\"tp-live-domain-pill\\\"> LIVE \\u2022 DTS-LOGISTICS.TECH<\\/span><\\/div><p><span class=\\\"member-badge-tag\\\" style=\\\"align-self: flex-start; margin-bottom: 8px;\\\">DISPATCH &amp; FLEET MODULE<\\/span><\\/p><h3 style=\\\"color: #0f172a; font-size: 1.14rem; font-weight: bold; margin: 4px 0 8px;\\\">DTS Dispatch, Route Replay &amp; Freight Estimator<\\/h3><p style=\\\"color: #64748b; font-size: 13.8px; line-height: 1.62; margin: 0;\\\">Interactive dispatch operations suite featuring GPS trip replay history, route management, freight rate estimator, driver mobile app sync, and 24\\/7 roadside dispatch alerts.<\\/p><ul class=\\\"tp-check-list\\\"><li><i class=\\\"fa-solid fa-circle-check\\\"><\\/i>Interactive Replay Center &amp; route tracking<\\/li><li><i class=\\\"fa-solid fa-circle-check\\\"><\\/i>Freight estimator &amp; Driver App coordination<\\/li><\\/ul><div class=\\\"tp-skill-row\\\" style=\\\"justify-content: flex-start; margin-top: 10px;\\\"><span class=\\\"tp-skill-chip\\\">Inertia.js<\\/span><span class=\\\"tp-skill-chip\\\">REST API<\\/span><span class=\\\"tp-skill-chip\\\">Tailwind CSS<\\/span><\\/div><div class=\\\"tp-project-visit-btn\\\"><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/dts-logistics.tech\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">Open Live System (dts-logistics.tech) <i class=\\\"fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square\\\"><\\/i><\\/a><\\/div><\\/div>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"1c5e74c\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"97e8134\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<div class=\\\"tp-project-card-inner\\\"><div class=\\\"tp-project-thumb-wrap\\\"><img class=\\\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-122\\\" src=\\\"http:\\/\\/professional-portfolio.test\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/11\\/PAYROLL-300x142.png\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"300\\\" height=\\\"142\\\" \\/><span class=\\\"tp-live-domain-pill\\\"> LIVE \\u2022 DTS-LOGISTICS.TECH<\\/span><\\/div><p><span class=\\\"member-badge-tag\\\" style=\\\"align-self: flex-start; margin-bottom: 8px;\\\">HR &amp; PAYROLL ENGINE<\\/span><\\/p><h3 style=\\\"color: #0f172a; font-size: 1.14rem; font-weight: bold; margin: 4px 0 8px;\\\">DTS Automated Driver &amp; Staff Payroll System<\\/h3><p style=\\\"color: #64748b; font-size: 13.8px; line-height: 1.62; margin: 0;\\\">Role-based Admin and Office Staff payroll module calculating driver trip allowances, overtime, deductions, and printable payslips tied directly to completed deliveries.<\\/p><ul class=\\\"tp-check-list\\