lor:#CBD5E1;\\\">02</span></div><h3 style=\\\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.14rem; font-weight:700; margin:6px 0 8px;\\\">User Manuals &amp; Onboarding Guides</h3><p style=\\\"color:#64748B; font-size:13.8px; line-height:1.65; margin:0;\\\">Creating step-by-step illustrated guides so non-technical admins and clients can operate systems effortlessly.</p><ul class=\\\"tp-check-list\\\"><li><i class=\\\"fa-solid fa-circle-check\\\"></i><span>Role-based step-by-step walkthroughs</span></li><li><i class=\\\"fa-solid fa-circle-check\\\"></i><span>Annotated screenshot instructions</span></li><li><i class=\\\"fa-solid fa-circle-check\\\"></i><span>FAQ &amp; troubleshooting playbooks</span></li></ul></div>\"}}]}, {\"id\": \"99f1d0c\", \"elType\": \"container\", \"isInner\": true, \"settings\": [], \"elements\": [{\"id\": \"72336c0\", \"elType\": \"widget\", \"isInner\": false, \"widgetType\": \"text-editor\", \"settings\": {\"editor\": \"<div style=\\\"text-align:left;\\\"><div style=\\\"display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center;\\\"><div class=\\\"tp-service-icon\\\"><i class=\\\"fa-solid fa-spell-check\\\"></i></div><span style=\\\"font-family:Poppins,sans-serif; font-size:22px; font-weight:800; color:#CBD5E1;\\\">03</span></div><h3 style=\\\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.14rem; font-weight:700; margin:6px 0 8px;\\\">Editing &amp; Presentation Decks</h3><p style=\\\"color:#64748B; font-size:13.8px; line-height:1.65; margin:0;\\\">Proofreading technical content, formatting citations, and writing persuasive defense and pitch presentations.</p><ul class=\\\"tp-check-list\\\"><li><i class=\\\"fa-solid fa-circle-check\\\"></i><span>Grammar &amp; technical consistency audits</span></li><li><i class=\\\"fa-solid fa-circle-check\\\"></i><span>Executive summaries &amp; release notes</span></li><li><i class=\\\"fa-solid fa-circle-check\\\"></i><span>Capstone defense slide copywriting</span></li></ul></div>\"}}]}]}]}, {\"id\": \"b344227\", \"elType\": \"container\", \