check\\\"><\\/i><span>Waybill tracking &amp; digital photo proof (e-POD)<\\/span><\\/li><\\/ul><div class=\\\"tp-skill-row\\\" style=\\\"justify-content:flex-start; margin-top:10px;\\\"><span class=\\\"tp-skill-chip\\\">Laravel<\\/span><span class=\\\"tp-skill-chip\\\">React \\/ Inertia<\\/span><span class=\\\"tp-skill-chip\\\">Mapbox GPS<\\/span><span class=\\\"tp-skill-chip\\\">MySQL<\\/span><\\/div><div class=\\\"tp-project-visit-btn\\\"><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/dts-logistics.tech\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">Open Live System (dts-logistics.tech) <i class=\\\"fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square\\\"><\\/i><\\/a><\\/div><\\/div>\"}}]},{\"id\":\"cb8912b\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"isInner\":true,\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"2c927f3\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"isInner\":false,\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<div class=\\\"tp-project-card-inner\\\"><div class=\\\"tp-project-thumb-wrap\\\"><img src=\\\"http:\\/\\/professional-portfolio.test\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/11\\/dts-logistics-preview.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Dennis Trucking Services Live Preview\\\"><span class=\\\"tp-live-domain-pill\\\"><span class=\\\"tp-live-dot\\\"><\\/span> LIVE \\u2022 DTS-LOGISTICS.TECH<\\/span><\\/div><span class=\\\"member-badge-tag\\\" style=\\\"align-self:flex-start; margin-bottom:8px;\\\">DISPATCH &amp; FLEET MODULE<\\/span><h3 style=\\\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.14rem; font-weight:700; margin:4px 0 8px;\\\">DTS Dispatch, Route Replay &amp; Freight Estimator<\\/h3><p style=\\\"color:#64748B; font-size:13.8px; line-height:1.62; margin:0;\\\">Interactive dispatch operations suite featuring GPS trip replay history, route management, freight rate estimator, driver mobile app sync, and 24\\/7 roadside dispatch alerts.<\\/p><ul class=\\\"tp-check-list\\\"><li><i class=\\\"fa-solid fa-circle-check\\\"><\\/i><span>Interactive Replay Center &amp; route tracking<\\/span><\\/li><li><i class=\\\"fa-solid fa-circle-check\\\"><\\/i><span>Freight estimator &amp; Driver App coordination<\\/span><\\/li><\\/ul><div class=\\\"tp-skill-row\\\" style=\\\"justify-content:flex-start; margin-top:10px;\\\"><span class=\\\"tp-skill-chip\\\">Inertia.js<\\/span><span class=\\\"tp-skill-chip\\\">REST API<\\/span><span class=\\\"tp-skill-chip\\\">Tailwind CSS<\\/span><\\/div><div class=\\\"tp-project-visit-btn\\\"><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/dts-logistics.tech\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">Open Live System (dts-logistics.tech) <i class=\\\"fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square\\\"><\\/i><\\/a><\\/div><\\/div>\"}}]},{\"id\":\"1c5e74c\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"isInner\":true,\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"97e8134\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"isInner\":false,\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<div class=\\\"tp-project-card-inner\\\"><div class=\\\"tp-project-thumb-wrap\\\"><img src=\\\"http:\\/\\/professional-portfolio.test\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/11\\/dts-logistics-preview.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Dennis Trucking Services Live Preview\\\"><span class=\\\"tp-live-domain-pill\\\"><span class=\\\"tp-live-dot\\\"><\\/span> LIVE \\u2022 DTS-LOGISTICS.TECH<\\/span><\\/div><span class=\\\"member-badge-tag\\\" style=\\\"align-self:flex-start; margin-bottom:8px;\\\">HR &amp; PAYROLL ENGINE<\\/span><h3 style=\\\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.14rem; font-weight:700; margin:4px 0 8px;\\\">DTS Automated Driver &amp; Staff Payroll System<\\/h3><p style=\\\"color:#64748B; font-size:13.8px; line-height:1.62; margin:0;\\\">Role-based Admin and Office Staff payroll module calculating driver trip allowances, overtime, deductions, and printable payslips tied directly to completed deliveries.<\\/p><ul class=\\\"tp-check-list\\\"><li><i class=\\\"fa-solid fa-circle-check\\\"><\\/i><span>Role-based Admin &amp; Office Staff portals<\\/span><\\/li><li><i class=\\\"fa-solid fa-circle-check\\\"><\\/i><span>Automated trip-based payroll computation<\\/span><\\/li><\\/ul><div class=\\\"tp-skill-row\\\" style