ers, MySQL tables, and JSON endpoints so data updates smoothly and securely.</p><ul class=\\\"tp-check-list\\\"><li><i class=\\\"fa-solid fa-circle-check\\\"></i><span>Normalized MySQL migrations &amp; queries</span></li><li><i class=\\\"fa-solid fa-circle-check\\\"></i><span>Input validation &amp; CSRF security</span></li><li><i class=\\\"fa-solid fa-circle-check\\\"></i><span>Automated calculation engines</span></li></ul></div>\"}}]}, {\"id\": \"8b28c72\", \"elType\": \"container\", \"isInner\": true, \"settings\": [], \"elements\": [{\"id\": \"f691e48\", \"elType\": \"widget\", \"isInner\": false, \"widgetType\": \"text-editor\", \"settings\": {\"editor\": \"<div style=\\\"text-align:left;\\\"><div style=\\\"display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center;\\\"><div class=\\\"tp-service-icon\\\"><i class=\\\"fa-solid fa-bug-slash\\\"></i></div><span style=\\\"font-family:Poppins,sans-serif; font-size:22px; font-weight:800; color:#CBD5E1;\\\">03</span></div><h3 style=\\\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.14rem; font-weight:700; margin:6px 0 8px;\\\">Debugging &amp; Deployment</h3><p style=\\\"color:#64748B; font-size:13.8px; line-height:1.65; margin:0;\\\">Troubleshooting server bugs, optimizing slow queries, and deploying clean builds on Laragon and web hosts.</p><ul class=\\\"tp-check-list\\\"><li><i class=\\\"fa-solid fa-circle-check\\\"></i><span>Performance profiling &amp; code refactoring</span></li><li><i class=\\\"fa-solid fa-circle-check\\\"></i><span>Git branching &amp; merge conflict fixes</span></li><li><i class=\\\"fa-solid fa-circle-check\\\"></i><span>Local &amp; production setup</span></li></ul></div>\"}}]}]}]}, {\"id\": \"60bedf2\", \"elType\": \"container\", \"isInner\": false, \"settings\": {\"_element_id\": \"member-about\", \"content_width\": \"boxed\"}, \"elements\": [{\"id\": \"383ad51\", \"elType\": \"widget\", \"isInner\": false, \"widgetType\": \"text-editor\", \"settings\": {\"editor\": \"<div style=\\\"text-align:center;\\\"><sp