rgin:0;\\\">Instant shipment search (e.g. DTS-882104) with driver photo Proof of Delivery capture and status updates.</p><div class=\\\"tp-code-preview-box\\\"><span class=\\\"tp-code-title\\\">Waybill Status Validation (PHP 8)</span><pre style=\\\"margin:0; white-space:pre-wrap; font-family:inherit; background:transparent; color:inherit; padding:0; border:none;\\\">$waybill = Waybill::with(&#039;epodPhoto&#039;)\\n  -&gt;where(&#039;tracking_no&#039;, $req-&gt;code)\\n  -&gt;firstOrFail();\\nreturn response()-&gt;json($waybill);</pre></div><ul class=\\\"tp-check-list\\\"><li><i class=\\\"fa-solid fa-circle-check\\\"></i><span>Public waybill lookup endpoint</span></li><li><i class=\\\"fa-solid fa-circle-check\\\"></i><span>Verified Digital Photo e-POD storage</span></li></ul></div>\"}}]}, {\"id\": \"3ffe04d\", \"elType\": \"container\", \"isInner\": true, \"settings\": [], \"elements\": [{\"id\": \"10308e5\", \"elType\": \"widget\", \"isInner\": false, \"widgetType\": \"text-editor\", \"settings\": {\"editor\": \"<div style=\\\"text-align:left;\\\"><span class=\\\"member-badge-tag\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom:8px;\\\">CODE HIGHLIGHT 03</span><h3 style=\\\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.12rem; font-weight:700; margin:4px 0 6px;\\\">Automated Payroll Formula Engine</h3><p style=\\\"color:#64748B; font-size:13.5px; line-height:1.58; margin:0;\\\">Server-side calculation in PayrollController.php powering Admin/Payroll.jsx and OfficeStaff/Payroll.jsx.</p><div class=\\\"tp-code-preview-box\\\"><span class=\\\"tp-code-title\\\">PayrollController.php Computation</span><pre style=\\\"margin:0; white-space:pre-wrap; font-family:inherit; background:transparent; color:inherit; padding:0; border:none;\\\">$gross = ($trips * $rate) + $overtime;\\n$netPay = $gross - ($sss + $philhealth + $ca);\\nreturn Inertia::render(&#039;Admin/Payroll&#039;, compact(&#039;netPay&#039;));</pre></div><ul class=\\\"tp-check-list\\\"><li><i class=\\\"fa-solid fa-circle-check\\\"></i><span>Zero manual arithmetic errors</span></li><li><i class=\\\"fa-solid fa-circle-check\\\"></i><span>Printable payslips &amp; audit trail</span></li></ul></div>\"}}]}]}]}, {\"id\": \"ae69b15\", \"elType\": \"container\", \"isInner\": false, \"settings\": {\"_element_id\": \"member-certifications\", \"content_width\": \"boxed\"}, \"elements\": [{\"id\": \"2bbd570\", \"elType\": \"widget\", \"isInner\": false, \"widgetType\": \"text-editor\", \"settings\": {\"editor\": \"<div style=\\\"text-align:center;\\\"><span class=\\\"section-pill-tag\\\">// CREDENTIALS &amp; TRAINING</span></div>\", \"align\": \"center\"}}, {\"id\": \"afb3b43\", \"elType\": \"widget\", \"isInner\": false, \"widgetType\": \"heading\", \"settings\": {\"title\": \"Certifications, Trainings & Seminars\", \"header_size\": \"h2\", \"align\": \"center\"}}, {\"id\": \"8a079bd\", \"elType\": \"container\", \"isInner\": true, \"settings\": {\"_element_id\": \"member-certs-grid\", \"flex_direction\": \"row\", \"flex_wrap\": \"wrap\"}, \"elements\": [{\"id\": \"743ced8\", \"elType\": \"container\", \"isInner\": true, \"settings\": [], \"elements\": [{\"id\": \"9b30450\", \"elType\": \"widget\", \"isInner\": false, \"widgetType\": \"text-editor\", \"settings\": {\"editor\": \"<div style=\\\"text-align:left;\\\"><div class=\\\"tp-cert-badge-row\\\"><div class=\\\"tp-cert-icon\\\"><i class=\\\"fa-solid fa-certificate\\\"></i></div><span class=\\\"member-badge-tag\\\" style=\\\"margin:0;\\\">2026</span></div><div style=\\\"font-size:12px; font-weight:700; color:#1E3A8A; margin-bottom:4px;\\\">Opol Community College • BSIT</div><h3 style=\\\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.1rem; font-weight:700; margin:0 0 8px;\\\">Capstone Production Deployment Recognition</h3><p style=\\\"color:#64748B; font-size:13.8px; line-height:1.6; margin:0;\\\">Built and deployed Dennis Trucking Services (dts-logistics.tech) on Ubuntu Nginx VPS with HTTPS SSL.</p></div>\"}}]}, {\"id\": \"9f2c05d\", \"elType\": \"container\", \"isInner\": true, \"settings\": 