pol, Misamis Oriental)</span></div><div style=\\\"margin-bottom:3px;\\\"><strong>Senior High School:</strong> Opol National Secondary Technical School <span style=\\\"color:#64748B;\\\">(Graduation Year: 2022 &bull; Opol, Misamis Oriental)</span></div><div style=\\\"margin-bottom:3px;\\\"><strong>College:</strong> Opol Community College <span style=\\\"color:#64748B;\\\">(Present &bull; Opol, Misamis Oriental)</span></div></div><div class=\\\"tp-cv-section-title\\\">Recognitions &amp; Seminars</div><p style=\\\"font-size:12px; color:#0F172A; line-height:1.45; margin:0;\\\">Capstone Production Deployment Recognition (2026) • Full-Stack Web Engineering Certificate (2025) • Relational Database &amp; Git Workflow Seminar (2024)</p><button type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"tp-print-btn\\\" onclick=\\\"window.print()\\\"><i class=\\\"fa-solid fa-print\\\"></i> Print / Save 1-Page Resume as PDF</button></div>\"}}]}]}]}, {\"id\": \"16701ca\", \"elType\": \"container\", \"isInner\": false, \"settings\": {\"_element_id\": \"member-contact\", \"content_width\": \"boxed\", \"background_background\": \"classic\", \"background_color\": \"#FFFFFF\"}, \"elements\": [{\"id\": \"e1875a7\", \"elType\": \"widget\", \"isInner\": false, \"widgetType\": \"text-editor\", \"settings\": {\"editor\": \"<div style=\\\"text-align:center;\\\"><span class=\\\"section-pill-tag\\\">// CONTACT ME</span></div>\", \"align\": \"center\"}}, {\"id\": \"b3af8b2\", \"elType\": \"widget\", \"isInner\": false, \"widgetType\": \"heading\", \"settings\": {\"title\": \"Get In Touch With Justin Maurin\", \"header_size\": \"h2\", \"align\": \"center\"}}, {\"id\": \"388eb7e\", \"elType\": \"container\", \"isInner\": true, \"settings\": {\"_element_id\": \"contact-grid-row\", \"flex_direction\": \"row\", \"flex_wrap\": \"wrap\"}, \"elements\": [{\"id\": \"ac639dd\", \"elType\": \"container\", \"isInner\": true, \"settings\": [], \"elements\": [{\"id\": \"da8b4bf\", \"elType\": \"widget\", \"isInner\": false, \"widgetTy