get\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<div style=\\\"text-align:left;\\\"><div style=\\\"display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center;\\\"><div class=\\\"tp-service-icon\\\"><i class=\\\"fa-solid fa-code\\\"><\\/i><\\/div><span style=\\\"font-family:Poppins,sans-serif; font-size:22px; font-weight:800; color:#CBD5E1;\\\">01<\\/span><\\/div><h3 style=\\\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.14rem; font-weight:700; margin:6px 0 8px;\\\">Web App Programming<\\/h3><p style=\\\"color:#64748B; font-size:13.8px; line-height:1.65; margin:0;\\\">Building custom full-stack web applications using Laravel, PHP 8, Inertia.js, and React with clean MVC architecture.<\\/p><ul class=\\\"tp-check-list\\\"><li><i class=\\\"fa-solid fa-circle-check\\\"><\\/i><span>Custom CRUD &amp; business logic modules<\\/span><\\/li><li><i class=\\\"fa-solid fa-circle-check\\\"><\\/i><span>Role-based login &amp; authentication<\\/span><\\/li><li><i class=\\\"fa-solid fa-circle-check\\\"><\\/i><span>Responsive Tailwind CSS frontends<\\/span><\\/li><\\/ul><\\/div>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"46c0d1d\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"aabbedc\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<div style=\\\"text-align:left;\\\"><div style=\\\"display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center;\\\"><div class=\\\"tp-service-icon\\\"><i class=\\\"fa-solid fa-server\\\"><\\/i><\\/div><span style=\\\"font-family:Poppins,sans-serif; font-size:22px; font-weight:800; color:#CBD5E1;\\\">02<\\/span><\\/div><h3 style=\\\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.14rem; font-weight:700; margin:6px 0 8px;\\\">API &amp; Database Integration<\\/h3><p style=\\\"color:#64748B; font-size:13.8px; line-height:1.65; margin:0;\\\">Connecting backend controllers, MySQL tables, and JSON endpoints so data updates smoothly and securely.<\\/p><ul class=\\\"tp-check-list\\\"><li><i class=\\\"fa-solid fa-circle-check\\\"><\\/i><span>Normalized My