INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (1,1,'2026-11-16 04:43:48','2026-11-16 04:43:48','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Welcome to WordPress. This is your first post. Edit or delete it, then start writing!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Hello world!','','publish','open','open','','hello-world','','','2026-11-16 04:43:48','2026-11-16 04:43:48','',0,'http://professional-portfolio.test/?p=1',0,'post','',1),(2,1,'2026-11-16 04:43:48','2026-11-16 04:43:48','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This is an example page. It\'s different from a blog post because it will stay in one place and will show up in your site navigation (in most themes). Most people start with an About page that introduces them to potential site visitors. It might say something like this:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Hi there! I\'m a bike messenger by day, aspiring actor by night, and this is my website. I live in Los Angeles, have a great dog named Jack, and I like pi&#241;a coladas. (And gettin\' caught in the rain.)</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>...or something like this:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The XYZ Doohickey Company was founded in 1971, and has been providing quality doohickeys to the public ever since. Located in Gotham City, XYZ employs over 2,000 people and does all kinds of awesome things for the Gotham community.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As a new WordPress user, you should go to <a href=\"http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-admin/\">your dashboard</a> to delete this page and create new pages for your content. Have fun!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Sample Page','','publish','closed','open','','sample-page','','','2026-11-16 04:43:48','2026-11-16 04:43:48','',0,'http://professional-portfolio.test/?page_id=2',0,'page','',0),(3,1,'2026-11-16 04:43:48','2026-11-16 04:43:48','<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Who we are</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>Our website address is: http://professional-portfolio.test.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Comments</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>When visitors leave comments on the site we collect the data shown in the comments form, and also the visitor&#8217;s IP address and browser user agent string to help spam detection.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>An anonymized string created from your email address (also called a hash) may be provided to the Gravatar service to see if you are using it. The Gravatar service privacy policy is available here: https://automattic.com/privacy/. After approval of your comment, your profile picture is visible to the public in the context of your comment.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Media</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>If you upload images to the website, you should avoid uploading images with embedded location data (EXIF GPS) included. Visitors to the website can download and extract any location data from images on the website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Cookies</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>If you leave a comment on our site you may opt-in to saving your name, email address and website in cookies. These are for your convenience so that you do not have to fill in your details again when you leave another comment. These cookies will last for one year.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you visit our login page, we will set a temporary cookie to determine if your browser accepts cookies. This cookie contains no personal data and is discarded when you close your browser.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When you log in, we will also set up several cookies to save your login information and your screen display choices. Login cookies last for two days, and screen options cookies last for a year. If you select &quot;Remember Me&quot;, your login will persist for two weeks. If you log out of your account, the login cookies will be removed.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you edit or publish an article, an additional cookie will be saved in your browser. This cookie includes no personal data and simply indicates the post ID of the article you just edited. It expires after 1 day.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Embedded content from other websites</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>Articles on this site may include embedded content (e.g. videos, images, articles, etc.). Embedded content from other websites behaves in the exact same way as if the visitor has visited the other website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These websites may collect data about you, use cookies, embed additional third-party tracking, and monitor your interaction with that embedded content, including tracking your interaction with the embedded content if you have an account and are logged in to that website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Who we share your data with</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>If you request a password reset, your IP address will be included in the reset email.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How long we retain your data</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>If you leave a comment, the comment and its metadata are retained indefinitely. This is so we can recognize and approve any follow-up comments automatically instead of holding them in a moderation queue.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For users that register on our website (if any), we also store the personal information they provide in their user profile. All users can see, edit, or delete their personal information at any time (except they cannot change their username). Website administrators can also see and edit that information.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What rights you have over your data</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>If you have an account on this site, or have left comments, you can request to receive an exported file of the personal data we hold about you, including any data you have provided to us. You can also request that we erase any personal data we hold about you. This does not include any data we are obliged to keep for administrative, legal, or security purposes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Where your data is sent</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>Visitor comments may be checked through an automated spam detection service.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n','Privacy Policy','','draft','closed','open','','privacy-policy','','','2026-11-16 04:43:48','2026-11-16 04:43:48','',0,'http://professional-portfolio.test/?page_id=3',0,'page','',0),(4,0,'2026-11-16 04:43:50','2026-11-16 04:43:50','<!-- wp:page-list /-->','Navigation','','publish','closed','closed','','navigation','','','2026-11-16 04:43:50','2026-11-16 04:43:50','',0,'http://professional-portfolio.test/2026/11/16/navigation/',0,'wp_navigation','',0),(5,1,'2026-11-16 04:44:19','0000-00-00 00:00:00','','Auto Draft','','auto-draft','open','open','','','','','2026-11-16 04:44:19','0000-00-00 00:00:00','',0,'http://professional-portfolio.test/?p=5',0,'post','',0),(6,1,'2026-11-16 04:53:17','0000-00-00 00:00:00','','Auto Draft','','auto-draft','open','open','','','','','2026-11-16 04:53:17','0000-00-00 00:00:00','',0,'http://professional-portfolio.test/?p=6',0,'post','',0),(7,1,'2026-11-16 04:53:17','2026-11-16 04:53:17','{\"version\": 3, \"isGlobalStylesUserThemeJSON\": true }','Custom Styles','','publish','closed','closed','','wp-global-styles-twentytwentyfive','','','2026-11-16 04:53:17','2026-11-16 04:53:17','',0,'http://professional-portfolio.test/2026/11/16/wp-global-styles-twentytwentyfive/',0,'wp_global_styles','',0),(8,1,'2026-11-16 05:25:38','2026-11-16 05:25:38','','Default Kit','','publish','closed','closed','','default-kit','','','2026-11-16 05:25:38','2026-11-16 05:25:38','',0,'http://professional-portfolio.test/?p=8',0,'elementor_library','',0),(9,1,'2026-11-16 05:37:20','2026-11-16 05:37:20','Hello There!<h1>We’re Team Teampura,<br>FROM Opol Community<br>College.</h1><p>A collaborative group of 4 BSIT students behind <strong>Dennis Trucking Services (dts-logistics.tech)</strong>—combining Programming, Project Management, System Analysis, and Technical Writing.</p><a href=\"https://dts-logistics.tech\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Our System (DTS)</a><a href=\"#team-section\">Meet Our Team ↓</a>													<img width=\"757\" height=\"636\" src=\"http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GROUP-PIC.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GROUP-PIC.png 757w, http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GROUP-PIC-300x252.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 757px) 100vw, 757px\" />													HIRE US<br>TEAM 4 Programmer &amp; Analyst PM &amp; Technical WriterSOFTWARE PROGRAMMING✦IT PROJECT MANAGEMENT✦SYSTEM ANALYSIS✦TECHNICAL WRITING✦OPOL COMMUNITY COLLEGE✦BSIT TEAM TEAMPURA✦SOFTWARE PROGRAMMING✦IT PROJECT MANAGEMENT✦SYSTEM ANALYSIS✦TECHNICAL WRITING✦OPOL COMMUNITY COLLEGE✦BSIT TEAM TEAMPURA✦// WHAT WE DO			<h2>Services We Provide</h2>		<p style=\"text-align:center; color:#64748B; font-size:16px; max-width:660px; margin:8px auto 12px;\">Every member owns a specialized discipline—from system analysis and project planning to full-stack programming and technical documentation.</p>01<h3 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.12rem; font-weight:700; margin:6px 0 8px;\">Software Programming</h3><p style=\"color:#64748B; font-size:13.5px; line-height:1.6; margin:0;\">Full-stack web and database programming using Laravel, PHP 8, React, and MySQL with clean architecture.</p><ul><li>Custom web applications &amp; APIs</li><li>Role-based authentication systems</li><li>Fast queries &amp; responsive views</li></ul> Lead: Justin Maurin02<h3 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.12rem; font-weight:700; margin:6px 0 8px;\">IT Project Management</h3><p style=\"color:#64748B; font-size:13.5px; line-height:1.6; margin:0;\">Structured Agile Scrum planning, milestone scheduling, and sprint coordination from kickoff to launch.</p><ul><li>WBS &amp; Gantt timeline planning</li><li>Task delegation &amp; sprint reviews</li><li>On-time stakeholder delivery</li></ul> Lead: Mike Iris Ebojo03<h3 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.12rem; font-weight:700; margin:6px 0 8px;\">System Analysis</h3><p style=\"color:#64748B; font-size:13.5px; line-height:1.6; margin:0;\">In-depth business workflow evaluation, requirement gathering, and precision ERD/DFD/UML system modeling.</p><ul><li>Current vs. proposed process maps</li><li>3NF relational database modeling</li><li>Feasibility &amp; logic verification</li></ul> Lead: Christian Angelo Enerio04<h3 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.12rem; font-weight:700; margin:6px 0 8px;\">Technical Writing</h3><p style=\"color:#64748B; font-size:13.5px; line-height:1.6; margin:0;\">Clear, structured Software Requirements Specifications (SRS), user manuals, and capstone manuscripts.</p><ul><li>IEEE-aligned SRS &amp; manuscripts</li><li>Step-by-step illustrated manuals</li><li>Clear UI copy &amp; defense decks</li></ul> Lead: Rhea Mae Marandang// WHO WE ARE			<h2>About Team Teampura</h2>		OUR STORY<h3 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.35rem; margin:4px 0 12px;\">BSIT Innovators from Opol Community College</h3><p style=\"color:#64748B; font-size:15px; line-height:1.75; margin-bottom:14px;\">Founded by 4 BSIT students at Opol Community College, Team Teampura unites Programming, Project Management, System Analysis, and Technical Writing under one roof.</p><p style=\"color:#64748B; font-size:15px; line-height:1.75; margin:0;\">With clear ownership across every phase of the SDLC, we ensure our software is well-analyzed, well-coded, well-managed, and thoroughly documented.</p>CORE PILLARS<h3 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.35rem; margin:4px 0 14px;\">Our Complete SDLC Team</h3><ul style=\"list-style:none; padding:0; margin:0; color:#0F172A; font-size:14.5px; line-height:2.1;\"><li><strong>Programming:</strong> Full-stack Laravel, React &amp; MySQL builds.</li><li><strong>Project Management:</strong> Structured Agile sprints &amp; deadlines.</li><li><strong>System Analysis:</strong> Accurate DFDs, ERDs &amp; process blueprints.</li><li><strong>Technical Writing:</strong> Crisp SRS manuscripts &amp; user guides.</li></ul>4Specialized IT Roles12+Tech Stacks & Tools6+Systems Engineered100%Team Collaboration// THE SQUAD			<h2>Our Team Members</h2>		<p style=\"text-align:center; color:#64748B; font-size:16px; max-width:650px; margin:8px auto 12px;\">Click “View Portfolio” on any member below to open their dedicated personal portfolio.</p>PROGRAMMER													<img width=\"913\" height=\"986\" src=\"http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/maurin.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/maurin.jpg 913w, http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/maurin-278x300.jpg 278w, http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/maurin-768x829.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 913px) 100vw, 913px\" />																<h3>Justin Maurin</h3>					<h5>Lead Programmer &amp; Software Developer</h5>		<p style=\"text-align:center; color:#64748B; font-size:13.5px; line-height:1.55; margin-bottom:10px;\">Writes clean, scalable application code, builds full-stack features, and integrates databases and APIs.</p>PHP &amp; LaravelJavaScript / ReactMySQL<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/share/1DqtmdqEuJ/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Justin Maurin (Facebook)\"></a><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/itz.me_tinay/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"@justin.maurin (Instagram)\"></a><a href=\"mailto:justin.maurin@teampura.it\" title=\"Email Justin Maurin\"></a>								<a href=\"http://professional-portfolio.test/justin-maurin/\">\n									View Portfolio →\n					</a>\n						PROJECT MANAGER													<img width=\"774\" height=\"1024\" src=\"http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/ebojo-774x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/ebojo-774x1024.jpg 774w, http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/ebojo-227x300.jpg 227w, http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/ebojo-768x1016.jpg 768w, http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/ebojo.jpg 896w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 774px) 100vw, 774px\" />																<h3>Mike Iris Ebojo</h3>					<h5>Project Manager &amp; Team Coordinator</h5>		<p style=\"text-align:center; color:#64748B; font-size:13.5px; line-height:1.55; margin-bottom:10px;\">Leads project planning, sprint scheduling, task delegation, and stakeholder coordination from kickoff to launch.</p>Project PlanningAgile &amp; ScrumTeam Leadership<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/share/1JvUr96ow8/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Mike Iris Ebojo (Facebook)\"></a><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/m4ykoooo/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"@mikeiris.ebojo (Instagram)\"></a><a href=\"mailto:mike.ebojo@teampura.it\" title=\"Email Mike Iris Ebojo\"></a>								<a href=\"http://professional-portfolio.test/mike-iris-ebojo/\">\n									View Portfolio →\n					</a>\n						SYSTEM ANALYST													<img width=\"867\" height=\"996\" src=\"http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/enerio.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/enerio.jpg 867w, http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/enerio-261x300.jpg 261w, http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/enerio-768x882.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 867px) 100vw, 867px\" />																<h3>Christian Angelo Enerio</h3>					<h5>System Analyst &amp; Process Designer</h5>		<p style=\"text-align:center; color:#64748B; font-size:13.5px; line-height:1.55; margin-bottom:10px;\">Evaluates business workflows, gathers system requirements, and designs ERDs, DFDs, and process blueprints.</p>System AnalysisERD &amp; DFDDatabase Design<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/share/1C8r81PJM3/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Christian Angelo Enerio (Facebook)\"></a><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/christian.tsx/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"@christian.enerio (Instagram)\"></a><a href=\"mailto:christian.enerio@teampura.it\" title=\"Email Christian Angelo Enerio\"></a>								<a href=\"http://professional-portfolio.test/christian-angelo-enerio/\">\n									View Portfolio →\n					</a>\n						TECHNICAL WRITER													<img width=\"808\" height=\"1024\" src=\"http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/rhea-808x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/rhea-808x1024.jpg 808w, http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/rhea-237x300.jpg 237w, http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/rhea-768x973.jpg 768w, http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/rhea.jpg 864w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 808px) 100vw, 808px\" />																<h3>Rhea Mae Marandang</h3>					<h5>Technical Writer &amp; Documentation Specialist</h5>		<p style=\"text-align:center; color:#64748B; font-size:13.5px; line-height:1.55; margin-bottom:10px;\">Authors clear Software Requirements Specifications (SRS), user manuals, API guides, and academic manuscripts.</p>Technical WritingSRS &amp; ManualsResearch Docs<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/share/1Bzmuhf7US/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Rhea Mae Marandang (Facebook)\"></a><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/luckyz_rhea/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"@rheamae.marandang (Instagram)\"></a><a href=\"mailto:rhea.marandang@teampura.it\" title=\"Email Rhea Mae Marandang\"></a>								<a href=\"http://professional-portfolio.test/rhea-mae-marandang/\">\n									View Portfolio →\n					</a>\n						// FEATURED WORK			<h2>Collaborative System: Dennis Trucking Services</h2>		<p style=\"text-align:center; color:#64748B; font-size:16px; max-width:720px; margin:8px auto 10px;\">Our flagship live production system at <a href=\"https://dts-logistics.tech\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color:#F97316; font-weight:700; text-decoration:underline;\">dts-logistics.tech</a> — designed, analyzed, programmed, and documented by Team Teampura for <strong>Dennis Trucking Services (Igpit, Opol)</strong>.</p><img src=\"http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/TRACK-300x143.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"143\" /><img src=\"http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dts-logistics-preview.jpg\" alt=\"Dennis Trucking Services Live Preview\" /> LIVE • DTS-LOGISTICS.TECH<p>FLAGSHIP LIVE SYSTEM</p><h3 style=\"color: #0f172a; font-size: 1.14rem; font-weight: bold; margin: 4px 0 8px;\">DTS Real-Time GPS Cargo &amp; Waybill Tracker</h3><p style=\"color: #64748b; font-size: 13.8px; line-height: 1.62; margin: 0;\">Production freight platform for Dennis Trucking Services (Igpit, Opol) with Mapbox live GPS fleet tracking, waybill number lookup (e.g. DTS-882104), and Digital Photo e-POD.</p><ul><li>Live GPS truck location &amp; speed telemetry</li><li>Waybill tracking &amp; digital photo proof (e-POD)</li></ul>LaravelReact / InertiaMapbox GPSMySQL<a href=\"https://dts-logistics.tech\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open Live System (dts-logistics.tech) </a><img src=\"http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/ROUTES-300x143.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"143\" /> LIVE • DTS-LOGISTICS.TECH<p>DISPATCH &amp; FLEET MODULE</p><h3 style=\"color: #0f172a; font-size: 1.14rem; font-weight: bold; margin: 4px 0 8px;\">DTS Dispatch, Route Replay &amp; Freight Estimator</h3><p style=\"color: #64748b; font-size: 13.8px; line-height: 1.62; margin: 0;\">Interactive dispatch operations suite featuring GPS trip replay history, route management, freight rate estimator, driver mobile app sync, and 24/7 roadside dispatch alerts.</p><ul><li>Interactive Replay Center &amp; route tracking</li><li>Freight estimator &amp; Driver App coordination</li></ul>Inertia.jsREST APITailwind CSS<a href=\"https://dts-logistics.tech\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open Live System (dts-logistics.tech) </a><img src=\"http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/PAYROLL-300x142.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"142\" /> LIVE • DTS-LOGISTICS.TECH<p>HR &amp; PAYROLL ENGINE</p><h3 style=\"color: #0f172a; font-size: 1.14rem; font-weight: bold; margin: 4px 0 8px;\">DTS Automated Driver &amp; Staff Payroll System</h3><p style=\"color: #64748b; font-size: 13.8px; line-height: 1.62; margin: 0;\">Role-based Admin and Office Staff payroll module calculating driver trip allowances, overtime, deductions, and printable payslips tied directly to completed deliveries.</p><ul><li>Role-based Admin &amp; Office Staff portals</li><li>Automated trip-based payroll computation</li></ul>PHP 8 / LaravelPayroll LogicSRS &amp; UAT<a href=\"https://dts-logistics.tech\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open Live System (dts-logistics.tech) </a>// REVIEWS &amp; FAQ			<h2>Feedback &amp; Quick Answers</h2>		<h3 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.25rem; margin-bottom:16px;\">Faculty &amp; Client Reviews</h3><p style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 8px;\">“Team Teampura delivered a remarkably clean payroll system backed by crystal-clear DFDs, strong sprint organization, and thorough SRS documentation.”</p><strong style=\"color:#1E3A8A; font-size:13px;\">— BSIT Capstone Panel Reviewer</strong><p style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 8px;\">“Smooth coordination from kickoff to defense—great coding, analysis, and user manuals.”</p><strong style=\"color:#1E3A8A; font-size:13px;\">— Project Stakeholder</strong><h3 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.25rem; margin-bottom:16px;\">Frequently Asked Questions</h3><details open><summary>Can we view each member’s individual portfolio?</summary><p>Yes! Use the Team Members dropdown in the header or click “View Portfolio →” on any card to open their dedicated portfolio page.</p></details><details><summary>What roles make up Team Teampura?</summary><p>Justin Maurin (Programmer), Mike Iris Ebojo (Project Manager), Christian Angelo Enerio (System Analyst), and Rhea Mae Marandang (Technical Writer).</p></details><details><summary>Are the team members open for internships or projects?</summary><p>Yes, all four BSIT members from Opol Community College are open for capstone collaborations and IT internships.</p></details><details><summary>Is this site editable via WordPress Elementor?</summary><p>Yes, every section and widget is stored as standard Elementor containers and widgets for drag-and-drop editing.</p></details>// GET IN TOUCH			<h2>Let’s Work Together</h2>		<h3 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.25rem; margin-bottom:14px;\">Team Contact Details</h3><p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\">Reach out to Team Teampura for academic projects, internship inquiries, or software development collaborations.</p><strong style=\"color:#0F172A; display:block;\">Team Email</strong>teampura.it@example.com<strong style=\"color:#0F172A; display:block;\">School</strong>Opol Community College • BSIT<strong style=\"color:#0F172A; display:block;\">Location</strong>Opol, Misamis Oriental, Philippines<h3 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.25rem; margin-bottom:14px;\">Send Us a Message</h3><form onsubmit=\"event.preventDefault(); var msg=this.querySelector(\'.tp-sent-msg\'); msg.style.display=\'block\'; this.reset();\"><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Your Full Name\" required><input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Your Email Address\" required><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Subject / Project Inquiry\"><textarea rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"Write your message here...\" required></textarea><button type=\"submit\">Send Message →</button><p style=\"display:none; color:#15803D; font-weight:600; font-size:13.5px; margin-top:10px;\">✓ Message sent! Team Teampura will reply shortly.</p></form>','Home','','publish','closed','closed','','home','','','2026-11-16 14:24:46','2026-11-16 14:24:46','',0,'http://professional-portfolio.test/?page_id=9',0,'page','',0),(10,1,'2026-11-16 05:31:51','2026-11-16 05:31:51','{\"version\": 3, \"isGlobalStylesUserThemeJSON\": true }','Custom Styles','','publish','closed','closed','','wp-global-styles-astra','','','2026-11-16 05:31:51','2026-11-16 05:31:51','',0,'http://professional-portfolio.test/2026/11/16/wp-global-styles-astra/',0,'wp_global_styles','',0),(12,1,'2026-11-16 05:38:35','2026-11-16 05:38:35','','Abo