-16 14:24:45','Hello There!<h1>We’re Team Teampura,<br />FROM Opol Community College.</h1><p>A collaborative group of 4 Information Technology students crafting scalable web systems, intuitive UI/UX designs, secure databases, and quality-assured software solutions.</p><a href=\"#team-section\">View Our Portfolio</a><a href=\"#contact-section\">Hire Our Team</a>													<img width=\"757\" height=\"636\" src=\"http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GROUP-PIC.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GROUP-PIC.png 757w, http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GROUP-PIC-300x252.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 757px) 100vw, 757px\" />													HIRE US<br>TEAM 4 Full-Stack &amp; UI/UX Database &amp; QAFULL-STACK WEB DEVELOPMENT✦UI/UX PRODUCT DESIGN✦DATABASE ARCHITECTURE✦QUALITY ASSURANCE✦LARAVEL &amp; REACT✦AGILE TEAMWORK✦FULL-STACK WEB DEVELOPMENT✦UI/UX PRODUCT DESIGN✦DATABASE ARCHITECTURE✦QUALITY ASSURANCE✦LARAVEL &amp; REACT✦AGILE TEAMWORK✦// WHAT WE DO			<h2>Services We Provide</h2>		<p style=\"text-align:center; color:#64748B; font-size:16px; max-width:640px; margin:8px auto 12px;\">Combining 4 specialized IT skill sets to take projects from concept and wireframe to tested deployment.</p>01<h3 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.12rem; font-weight:700; margin:6px 0 8px;\">Full-Stack Web Apps</h3><p style=\"color:#64748B; font-size:13.8px; line-height:1.65; margin:0;\">Scalable Laravel, PHP, and React systems engineered with clean REST APIs and role-based dashboards.</p>02<h3 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.12rem; font-weight:700; margin:6px 0 8px;\">UI/UX Product Design</h3><p style=\"color:#64748B; font-size:13.8px; line-height:1.65; margin:0;\">Modern Figma wireframes, accessible component systems, and responsive Tailwind CSS layouts.</p>03<h3 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.12rem; font-weight:700; margin:6px 0 8px;\">Database & Security</h3><p style=\"color:#64748B; font-size:13.8px; line-height:1.65; margin:0;\">Normalized MySQL schemas, fast SQL indexing, input validation, and reliable data integrity.</p>04<h3 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.12rem; font-weight:700; margin:6px 0 8px;\">QA & System Analysis</h3><p style=\"color:#64748B; font-size:13.8px; line-height:1.65; margin:0;\">Comprehensive UAT test matrices, UML process diagrams, and clear end-user documentation.</p>// WHO WE ARE			<h2>About Team Teampura</h2>		OUR STORY<h3 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.35rem; margin:4px 0 12px;\">Four Minds Driven by Clean Code &amp; Practical Impact</h3><p style=\"color:#64748B; font-size:15px; line-height:1.75; margin-bottom:14px;\">Founded by 4 BSIT students, Team Teampura bridges academic software engineering fundamentals with modern production workflows.</p><p style=\"color:#64748B; font-size:15px; line-height:1.75; margin:0;\">Each member leads a core pillar—Full-Stack Architecture, UI/UX Design, Database Engineering, and Quality Assurance—so every project delivers polish and reliability.</p>CORE PILLARS<h3 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.35rem; margin:4px 0 14px;\">How We Build Together</h3><ul style=\"list-style:none; padding:0; margin:0; color:#0F172A; font-size:14.5px; line-height:2.1;\"><li><strong>Agile Sprints:</strong> Weekly milestone tracking and peer code reviews.</li><li><strong>Clean UI/UX:</strong> Accessible, mobile-first design systems in Figma.</li><li><strong>Secure Backends:</strong> Normalized 3NF databases and validated APIs.</li><li><strong>Verified Quality:</strong> Structured UAT test matrices before every launch.</li></ul>4Core IT Specialists12+Modern Tech Stacks6+Systems Engineered100%Agile Collaboration// THE SQUAD			<h2>Our Team Members</h2>		<p style=\"text-align:center; color:#64748B; font-size:16px; max-width:650px; margin:8px auto 12px;\">Click “View Portfolio” on any member below to open their dedicated personal portfolio.</p>TEAM LEAD													<img width=\"913\" height=\"986\" src=\"http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/maurin.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/maurin.jpg 913w, http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/maurin-278x300.jpg 278w, http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/maurin-768x829.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 913px) 100vw, 913px\" />																<h3>Justin Maurin</h3>					<h5>Lead Full-Stack Developer</h5>		<p style=\"text-align:center; color:#64748B; font-size:13.5px; line-height:1.55; margin-bottom:10px;\">Leads system architecture, backend REST APIs, and database modeling with Laravel, PHP, and MySQL.</p>PHP / LaravelMySQLREST API<a href=\"https://github.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"GitHub\"></a><a href=\"https://linkedin.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"LinkedIn\"></a><a href=\"mailto:justin.maurin@teampura.it\" title=\"Email\"></a>								<a href=\"http://professional-portfolio.test/justin-maurin/\">\n									View Portfolio →\n					</a>\n						UI / UX													<img width=\"774\" height=\"1024\" src=\"http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/ebojo-774x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/ebojo-774x1024.jpg 774w, http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/ebojo-227x300.jpg 227w, http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/ebojo-768x1016.jpg 768w, http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/ebojo.jpg 896w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 774px) 100vw, 774px\" />																<h3>Mike Iris Ebojo</h3>					<h5>Frontend &amp; UI/UX Specialist</h5>		<p style=\"text-align:center; color:#64748B; font-size:13.5px; line-height:1.55; margin-bottom:10px;\">Crafts responsive layouts, Figma design systems, Tailwind CSS styling, and interactive components.</p>React.jsTailwind CSSFigma<a href=\"https://github.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"GitHub\"></a><a href=\"https://linkedin.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"LinkedIn\"></a><a href=\"mailto:mike.ebojo@teampura.it\" title=\"Email\"></a>								<a href=\"http://professional-portfolio.test/mike-iris-ebojo/\">\n									View Portfolio →\n					</a>\n						BACKEND													<img width=\"867\" height=\"996\" src=\"http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/enerio.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/enerio.jpg 867w, http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/enerio-261x300.jpg 261w, http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/enerio-768x882.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 867px) 100vw, 867px\" />																<h3>Christian Angelo Enerio</h3>					<h5>Database &amp; Backend Engineer</h5>		<p style=\"text-align:center; color:#64748B; font-size:13.5px; line-height:1.55; margin-bottom:10px;\">Designs normalized relational databases, query optimization, data security, and server logic.</p>SQL SchemaNode.jsSecurity<a href=\"https://github.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"GitHub\"></a><a href=\"https://linkedin.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"LinkedIn\"></a><a href=\"mailto:christian.enerio@teampura.it\" title=\"Email\"></a>								<a href=\"http://professional-portfolio.test/christian-angelo-enerio/\">\n									View Portfolio →\n					</a>\n						QA & DOCS													<img width=\"808\" height=\"1024\" src=\"http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/rhea-808x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/rhea-808x1024.jpg 808w, http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/rhea-237x300.jpg 237w, http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/rhea-768x973.jpg 768w, http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/rhea.jpg 864w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 808px) 100vw, 808px\" />																<h3>Rhea Mae Marandang</h3>					<h5>QA Engineer &amp; System Analyst</h5>		<p style=\"text-align:center; color:#64748B; font-size:13.5px; line-height:1.55; margin-bottom:10px;\">Executes comprehensive test plans, system requirement analysis, bug reporting, and documentation.</p>QA TestingAnalysisAgile Docs<a href=\"https://github.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"GitHub\"></a><a href=\"https://linkedin.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"LinkedIn\"></a><a href=\"mailto:rhea.marandang@teampura.it\" title=\"Email\"></a>								<a href=\"http://professional-portfolio.test/rhea-mae-marandang/\">\n									View Portfolio →\n					</a>\n						// FEATURED WORK			<h2>Collaborative Projects</h2>		<p style=\"text-align:center; color:#64748B; font-size:16px; max-width:640px; margin:8px auto 10px;\">Web applications and software systems designed, coded, and verified by Team Teampura.</p>ENTERPRISE WEB APP<h3 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.15rem; font-weight:700; margin:6px 0 8px;\">Automated Payroll & HR System</h3><p style=\"color:#64748B; font-size:14px; line-height:1.65; margin:0;\">Full-stack payroll calculation engine with attendance tracking, overtime deductions, and staff dashboards.</p>LaravelInertia.jsTailwindMySQLWEB ARCHITECTURE<h3 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.15rem; font-weight:700; margin:6px 0 8px;\">Teampura Multi-Member Portal</h3><p style=\"color:#64748B; font-size:14px; line-height:1.65; margin:0;\">Modular team and individual portfolio platform built with WordPress, Elementor Flexbox grids, and motion CSS.</p>WordPressElementorCSS3INFORMATION SYSTEM<h3 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.15rem; font-weight:700; margin:6px 0 8px;\">Academic Capstone Repository</h3><p style=\"color:#64748B; font-size:14px; line-height:1.65; margin:0;\">Centralized portal for research defense schedules, manuscript tracking, and faculty evaluation workflows.</p>PHP 8REST APIMySQL// REVIEWS &amp; FAQ			<h2>Feedback &amp; Quick Answers</h2>		<h3 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.25rem; margin-bottom:16px;\">Faculty &amp; Client Reviews</h3><p style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 8px;\">“Team Teampura delivered a remarkably clean payroll workflow with organized database architecture and thorough QA documentation.”</p><strong style=\"color:#1E3A8A; font-size:13px;\">— BSIT Capstone Panel Reviewer</strong><p style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 8px;\">“Responsive UI, reliable backend endpoints, and seamless collaboration between all four members.”</p><strong style=\"color:#1E3A8A; font-size:13px;\">— Project Stakeholder</strong><h3 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.25rem; margin-bottom:16px;\">Frequently Asked Questions</h3><details open><summary>Can we view each member’s individual portfolio?</summary><p>Yes! Use the Team Members dropdown in the header or click “View Portfolio →” on any card to open their dedicated portfolio page.</p></details><details><summary>What technologies does Team Teampura specialize in?</summary><p>We build primarily with PHP 8, Laravel, Inertia.js, React, Tailwind CSS, MySQL, WordPress/Elementor, and Figma.</p></details><details><summary>Are the team members open for internships or projects?</summary><p>Yes, all four BSIT members are open for capstone collaborations, freelance web builds, and IT internships.</p></details><details><summary>Is this site editable via WordPress Elementor?</summary><p>Yes, every section and widget is stored as standard Elementor containers and widgets for drag-and-drop editing.</p></details>// GET IN TOUCH			<h2>Let’s Work Together</h2>		<h3 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.25rem; margin-bottom:14px;\">Team Contact Details</h3><p style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\">Reach out to Team Teampura for academic projects, internship inquiries, or web development collaborations.</p><strong style=\"color:#0F172A; display:block;\">Team Email</strong>teampura.it@example.com<strong style=\"color:#0F172A; display:block;\">Program</strong>BS Information Technology • Class of 2026<strong style=\"color:#0F172A; display:block;\">Location</strong>Philippines • Available Remote &amp; On-Site<h3 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.25rem; margin-bottom:14px;\">Send Us a Message</h3><form onsubmit=\"event.preventDefault(); var msg=this.querySelector(\'.tp-sent-msg\'); msg.style.display=\'block\'; this.reset();\"><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Your Full Name\" required><input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Your Email Address\" required><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Subject / Project Inquiry\"><textarea rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"Write your message here...\" required></textarea><button type=\"submit\">Send Message →</button><p style=\"display:none; color:#15803D; font-weight:600; font-size:13.5px; margin-top:10px;\">✓ Message sent! Team Teampura will reply shortly.</p></form>			Accordion Item 1\n					<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; overflow: unset;\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.46967 9.21967C5.76256 8.92678 6.23744 8.92678 6.53033 9.21967L12 14.6893L17.4697 9.21967C17.7626 8.92678 18.2374 8.92678 18.5303 9.21967C18.8232 9.51256 18.8232 9.98744 18.5303 10.2803L12.5303 16.2803C12.2374 16.5732 11.7626 16.5732 11.4697 16.2803L5.46967 10.2803C5.17678 9.98744 5.17678 9.51256 5.46967 9.21967Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path></svg>\n					Accordion Item 2\n					<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; overflow: unset;\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.46967 9.21967C5.76256 8.92678 6.23744 8.92678 6.53033 9.21967L12 14.6893L17.4697 9.21967C17.7626 8.92678 18.2374 8.92678 18.5303 9.21967C18.8232 9.51256 18.8232 9.98744 18.5303 10.2803L12.5303 16.2803C12.2374 16.5732 11.7626 16.5732 11.4697 16.2803L5.46967 10.2803C5.17678 9.98744 5.17678 9.51256 5.46967 9.21967Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path></svg>','Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','9-revision-v1','','','2026-11-