s.</p>03<h3 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.12rem; font-weight:700; margin:6px 0 8px;\">Database & Security</h3><p style=\"color:#64748B; font-size:13.8px; line-height:1.65; margin:0;\">Normalized MySQL schemas, fast SQL indexing, input validation, and reliable data integrity.</p>04<h3 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.12rem; font-weight:700; margin:6px 0 8px;\">QA & System Analysis</h3><p style=\"color:#64748B; font-size:13.8px; line-height:1.65; margin:0;\">Comprehensive UAT test matrices, UML process diagrams, and clear end-user documentation.</p>// WHO WE ARE			<h2>About Team Teampura</h2>		OUR STORY<h3 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.35rem; margin:4px 0 12px;\">Four Minds Driven by Clean Code &amp; Practical Impact</h3><p style=\"color:#64748B; font-size:15px; line-height:1.75; margin-bottom:14px;\">Founded by 4 BSIT students, Team Teampura bridges academic software engineering fundamentals with modern production workflows.</p><p style=\"color:#64748B; font-size:15px; line-height:1.75; margin:0;\">Each member leads a core pillar—Full-Stack Architecture, UI/UX Design, Database Engineering, and Quality Assurance—so every project delivers polish and reliability.</p>CORE PILLARS<h3 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.35rem; margin:4px 0 14px;\">How We Build Together</h3><ul style=\"list-style:none; padding:0; margin:0; color:#0F172A; font-size:14.5px; line-height:2.1;\"><li><strong>Agile Sprints:</strong> Weekly milestone tracking and peer code reviews.</li><li><strong>Clean UI/UX:</strong> Accessible, mobile-first design systems in Figma.</li><li><strong>Secure Backends:</strong> Normalized 3NF databases and validated APIs.</li><li><strong>Verified Quality:</strong> Structured UAT test matrices before every launch.</li></ul>4Core IT Specialists12+Modern Tech Stacks6+Systems Engineered100%Agile Collaboration// THE SQUAD			<h2>Our Team Members</h2>		<p style=\"text-align:center; color:#64748B; font-size:16px; max-width:650px; margin:8px auto 12px;\">Click “View Portfolio” on any member below to open their dedicated personal portfolio.</p>TEAM LEAD													<img width=\"913\" height=\"986\" src=\"http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/maurin.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/maurin.jpg 913w, http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/maurin-278x300.jpg 278w, http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/maurin-768x829.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 913px) 100vw, 913px\" />																<h3>Justin Maurin</h3>					<h5>Lead Full-Stack Developer</h5>		<p style=\"text-align:center; color:#64748B; font-size:13.5px; line-height:1.55; margin-bottom:10px;\">Leads system architecture, backend REST APIs, and database modeling with Laravel, PHP, and MySQL.</p>PHP / LaravelMySQLREST API<a href=\"https://github.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"GitHub\"></a><a href=\"https://linkedin.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"LinkedIn\"></a><a href=\"mailto:justin.maurin@teampura.it\" title=\"Email\"></a>								<a href=\"http://professional-portfolio.test/justin-maurin/\">\n									View Portfolio →\n					</a>\n						UI / UX													<img width=\"774\" height=\"1024\" src=\"http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/ebojo-774x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/ebojo-774x1024.jpg 774w, http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/ebojo-227x300.jpg 227w, http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/ebojo-768x1016.jpg 768w, http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/ebojo.jpg 896w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 774px) 100vw, 774px\" />																<h3>Mike Iris Ebojo</h3>					<h5>Frontend &amp; UI/UX Specialist</h5>		<p style=\"text-align:center; color:#64748B; font-size:13.5px; line-height:1.55; margin-bottom:10px;\">Crafts responsive layouts, Figma design systems, Tailwind CSS styling, and interactive components.