gram</strong>BS Information Technology • Class of 2026<strong style=\"color:#0F172A; display:block;\">Location</strong>Philippines • Available Remote &amp; On-Site<h3 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.25rem; margin-bottom:14px;\">Send Us a Message</h3><form onsubmit=\"event.preventDefault(); var msg=this.querySelector(\'.tp-sent-msg\'); msg.style.display=\'block\'; this.reset();\"><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Your Full Name\" required><input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Your Email Address\" required><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Subject / Project Inquiry\"><textarea rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"Write your message here...\" required></textarea><button type=\"submit\">Send Message →</button><p style=\"display:none; color:#15803D; font-weight:600; font-size:13.5px; margin-top:10px;\">✓ Message sent! Team Teampura will reply shortly.</p></form>			Accordion Item 1\n					<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; overflow: unset;\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.46967 9.21967C5.76256 8.92678 6.23744 8.92678 6.53033 9.21967L12 14.6893L17.4697 9.21967C17.7626 8.92678 18.2374 8.92678 18.5303 9.21967C18.8232 9.51256 18.8232 9.98744 18.5303 10.2803L12.5303 16.2803C12.2374 16.5732 11.7626 16.5732 11.4697 16.2803L5.46967 10.2803C5.17678 9.98744 5.17678 9.51256 5.46967 9.21967Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path></svg>\n					Accordion Item 2\n					<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; overflow: unset;\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.46967 9.21967C5.76256 8.92678 6.23744 8.92678 6.53033 9.21967L12 14.6893L17.4697 9.21967C17.7626 8.92678 18.2374 8.92678 18.5303 9.21967C18.8232 9.51256 18.8232 9.98744 18.5303 10.2803L12.5303 16.2803C12.2374 16.5732 11.7626 16.5732 11.4697 16.2803L5.46967 10.2803C5.17678 9.98744 5.17