FLEET MODULE</p><h3 style=\"color: #0f172a; font-size: 1.14rem; font-weight: bold; margin: 4px 0 8px;\">DTS Dispatch, Route Replay &amp; Freight Estimator</h3><p style=\"color: #64748b; font-size: 13.8px; line-height: 1.62; margin: 0;\">Interactive dispatch operations suite featuring GPS trip replay history, route management, freight rate estimator, driver mobile app sync, and 24/7 roadside dispatch alerts.</p><ul><li>Interactive Replay Center &amp; route tracking</li><li>Freight estimator &amp; Driver App coordination</li></ul>Inertia.jsREST APITailwind CSS<a href=\"https://dts-logistics.tech\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open Live System (dts-logistics.tech) </a><img src=\"http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/PAYROLL-300x142.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"142\" /> LIVE • DTS-LOGISTICS.TECH<p>HR &amp; PAYROLL ENGINE</p><h3 style=\"color: #0f172a; font-size: 1.14rem; font-weight: bold; margin: 4px 0 8px;\">DTS Automated Driver &amp; Staff Payroll System</h3><p style=\"color: #64748b; font-size: 13.8px; line-height: 1.62; margin: 0;\">Role-based Admin and Office Staff payroll module calculating driver trip allowances, overtime, deductions, and printable payslips tied directly to completed deliveries.</p><ul><li>Role-based Admin &amp; Office Staff portals</li><li>Automated trip-based payroll computation</li></ul>PHP 8 / LaravelPayroll LogicSRS &amp; UAT<a href=\"https://dts-logistics.tech\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open Live System (dts-logistics.tech) </a>// REVIEWS &amp; FAQ			<h2>Feedback &amp; Quick Answers</h2>		<h3 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.25rem; margin-bottom:16px;\">Faculty &amp; Client Reviews</h3><p style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 8px;\">“Team Teampura delivered a remarkably clean payroll system backed by crystal-clear DFDs, strong sprint organization, and thorough SRS documentation.”</p><strong style=\"color:#1E3A8A; font-size:13px;\">— BSIT Capstone Panel Reviewer