26-11-16 14:31:41','2026-11-16 14:31:41','',40,'http://professional-portfolio.test/?p=129',0,'revision','',0),(130,1,'2026-11-16 14:31:42','2026-11-16 14:31:42','Hello There!<h1>I’m Justin Maurin,<br>Programmer<br>From OCC.</h1><p>I am a dedicated BSIT Programmer at Opol Community College and the lead developer behind Dennis Trucking Services (dts-logistics.tech). Using PHP, Laravel, React, Inertia.js, and MySQL, I turn logistics requirements into fast, production-ready software.</p><a href=\"https://dts-logistics.tech\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View My Projects</a><a href=\"#member-contact\">Hire Me</a>													<img width=\"913\" height=\"986\" src=\"http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/maurin.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/maurin.jpg 913w, http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/maurin-278x300.jpg 278w, http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/maurin-768x829.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 913px) 100vw, 913px\" />													HIRE ME<br>AVAILABLE Full-Stack Programmer Laravel &amp; React BuilderPROGRAMMING✦PHP &amp; LARAVEL✦REACT &amp; INERTIA.JS✦MYSQL QUERIES✦RESTFUL APIS✦CLEAN CODE✦OPOL COMMUNITY COLLEGE✦PROGRAMMING✦PHP &amp; LARAVEL✦REACT &amp; INERTIA.JS✦MYSQL QUERIES✦RESTFUL APIS✦CLEAN CODE✦OPOL COMMUNITY COLLEGE✦// MY SERVICES • PROGRAMMER			<h2>Services I Provide</h2>		01<h3 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.14rem; font-weight:700; margin:6px 0 8px;\">Web App Programming</h3><p style=\"color:#64748B; font-size:13.8px; line-height:1.65; margin:0;\">Building custom full-stack web applications using Laravel, PHP 8, Inertia.js, and React with clean MVC architecture.</p><ul><li>Custom CRUD &amp; business logic modules</li><li>Role-based login &amp; authentication</li><li>Responsive Tailwind CSS frontends</li></ul>02<h3 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.14rem; font-weight:700; margin:6px 0 8px;\">API &amp; Database Integration</h3><p style=\"color:#64748B; font-size:13.8px; line-height:1.65; margin:0;\">Connecting backend controllers, MySQL tables, and JSON endpoints so data updates smoothly and securely.</p><ul><li>Normalized MySQL migrations &amp; queries</li><li>Input validation &amp; CSRF security</li><li>Automated calculation engines</li></ul>03<h3 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.14rem; font-weight:700; margin:6px 0 8px;\">Debugging &amp; Deployment</h3><p style=\"color:#64748B; font-size:13.8px; line-height:1.65; margin:0;\">Troubleshooting server bugs, optimizing slow queries, and deploying clean builds on Laragon and web hosts.</p><ul><li>Performance profiling &amp; code refactoring</li><li>Git branching &amp; merge conflict fixes</li><li>Local &amp; production setup</li></ul>// PERSONAL BIO			<h2>About Me</h2>		ABOUT ME • PROGRAMMER<h3 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.35rem; margin:4px 0 12px;\">Who is Justin Maurin?</h3><p style=\"color:#64748B; font-size:14.8px; line-height:1.75; margin-bottom:12px;\">I am a dedicated BSIT Programmer at Opol Community College specializing in full-stack web development with PHP, Laravel, JavaScript, React, and MySQL. I turn technical requirements and system designs into fast, bug-free, working software.</p><p style=\"color:#64748B; font-size:14.8px; line-height:1.75; margin:0;\">From structuring controllers, REST endpoints, and database migrations to building responsive UI views, I focus on clean code readability, security, and reliable performance across every sprint.</p>10+Apps Coded18+Modules Shipped98%Code Reliability4 yrsCoding ExperiencePERSONAL INFORMATION &amp; SOCIALS<h3 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.35rem; margin:4px 0 12px;\">Personal Profile</h3>Full Name<strong style=\"color:#0F172A; text-align:right; line-height:1.45;\">Justin B. Maurin</strong>Course<strong style=\"color:#1E3A8A; text-align:right; line-height:1.45;\">Bachelor of Science in Information Technology</strong>Role<strong style=\"color:#1E3A8A; text-align:right; line-height:1.45;\">Lead Programmer &amp; Software Developer</strong>Location<strong style=\"color:#0F172A; text-align:right; line-height:1.45;\">Igpit, Opol, Misamis Oriental</strong>Birth Residence<strong style=\"color:#0F172A; text-align:right; line-height:1.45;\">NMMC</strong>Birthday<strong style=\"color:#0F172A; text-align:right; line-height:1.45;\">August 17, 2003</strong>Mobile Number<strong style=\"color:#0F172A; text-align:right; line-height:1.45;\"><a href=\"tel:09301412288\" style=\"color:#0F172A; text-decoration:none;\">09301412288</a></strong>Email Address<strong style=\"color:#F97316; text-align:right; line-height:1.45;\"><a href=\"mailto:occ.maurin.justin@gmail.com\" style=\"color:#F97316; text-decoration:none;\">occ.maurin.justin@gmail.com</a></strong>Language<strong style=\"color:#15803D; text-align:right; line-height:1.45;\">Bisaya</strong><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/share/1DqtmdqEuJ/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Justin B. Maurin (Facebook)\"></a><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/itz.me_tinay/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"@itz.me_tinay (Instagram)\"></a><a href=\"mailto:occ.maurin.justin@gmail.com\" title=\"Email Justin B. Maurin\"></a><a href=\"tel:09301412288\" title=\"Call 09301412288\"></a><a href=\"#member-cv-section\">View / Print 1-Page CV</a><a href=\"http://professional-portfolio.test/#team-section\">&larr; Team Home</a>// SCHOOL GRADUATED			<h2>Educational Background (Elementary to College)</h2>		<p style=\"text-align:center; color:#64748B; font-size:14.5px; max-width:680px; margin:0 auto;\">Academic milestones of <strong>Justin B. Maurin</strong> from Elementary through College at Opol Community College.</p>													<img width=\"517\" height=\"517\" src=\"http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/IES.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/IES.png 517w, http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/IES-300x300.png 300w, http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/IES-150x150.png 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 517px) 100vw, 517px\" />													ELEMENTARYGraduation Year: 2016<h4 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.02rem; font-weight:700; line-height:1.35; margin:0 0 8px;\">Igpit Elementary School</h4><p style=\"color:#64748B; font-size:12.8px; line-height:1.5; margin:0; display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:6px;\">Igpit, Opol, Misamis Oriental</p>													<img width=\"757\" height=\"636\" src=\"http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GROUP-PIC.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GROUP-PIC.png 757w, http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GROUP-PIC-300x252.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 757px) 100vw, 757px\" />													HIGH SCHOOLGraduation Year: 2020<h4 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.02rem; font-weight:700; line-height:1.35; margin:0 0 8px;\">Opol National Secondary Technical School</h4><p style=\"color:#64748B; font-size:12.8px; line-height:1.5; margin:0; display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:6px;\">Opol, Misamis Oriental</p>													<img width=\"757\" height=\"636\" src=\"http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GROUP-PIC.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GROUP-PIC.png 757w, http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GROUP-PIC-300x252.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 757px) 100vw, 757px\" />													SENIOR HIGH SCHOOLGraduation Year: 2022<h4 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.02rem; font-weight:700; line-height:1.35; margin:0 0 8px;\">Opol National Secondary Technical School</h4><p style=\"color:#64748B; font-size:12.8px; line-height:1.5; margin:0; display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:6px;\">Opol, Misamis Oriental</p>													<img width=\"757\" height=\"636\" src=\"http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GROUP-PIC.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GROUP-PIC.png 757w, http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GROUP-PIC-300x252.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 757px) 100vw, 757px\" />													COLLEGEPresent<h4 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.02rem; font-weight:700; line-height:1.35; margin:0 0 8px;\">Opol Community College</h4><p style=\"color:#64748B; font-size:12.8px; line-height:1.5; margin:0; display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:6px;\">Opol, Misamis Oriental</p>// HOBBIES &amp; INTERESTS			<h2>Hobbies &amp; Personal Interests</h2>		TECH CRAFT<h4 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.05rem; font-weight:700; margin:2px 0 8px;\">Coding Side Projects</h4><p style=\"color:#64748B; font-size:13.3px; line-height:1.6; margin:0;\">Building full-stack web prototypes, testing Laravel &amp; React packages, and refining clean system architecture patterns.</p>SYSADMIN<h4 style=\"color: #0f172a; font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: bold; margin: 2px 0 8px;\">Exploring Linux &amp; Dev Tools</h4><p style=\"color: #64748b; font-size: 13.3px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Configuring Nginx servers, VPS deployments, SSH workflows, and developer shortcuts for faster shipping.</p>LEARNING<h4 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.05rem; font-weight:700; margin:2px 0 8px;\">Tech Videos &amp; Tutorials</h4><p style=\"color:#64748B; font-size:13.3px; line-height:1.6; margin:0;\">Keeping up with modern PHP 8, SQL query optimization, and frontend performance engineering breakdowns.</p>GAMING<h4 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.05rem; font-weight:700; margin:2px 0 8px;\">Online Strategy Gaming</h4><p style=\"color:#64748B; font-size:13.3px; line-height:1.6; margin:0;\">Unwinding after long coding sprints with competitive games that sharpen teamwork and quick decision-making.</p>// SKILLS &amp; RESUME			<h2>Skills &amp; Experience Timeline</h2>		SKILLS MATRIX<h3 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.3rem; margin:2px 0 16px;\">My Technical Proficiencies</h3>PHP 8 &amp; Laravel Programming96%JavaScript, React &amp; Inertia.js90%MySQL Database &amp; Queries92%HTML5, CSS3 &amp; Tailwind UI89%Debugging &amp; Git Version Control93%Core Competencies &amp; ToolsPHP 8.2LaravelReact.jsInertia.jsMySQLTailwind CSSREST APIGit / GitHubEXPERIENCE<h3 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.3rem; margin:2px 0 18px;\">My Experience &amp; Education</h3>2025 – 2026Lead Programmer • Team Teampura<p>Writing core application code, integrating system modules, and reviewing pull requests for capstone and client builds.</p>LEAD PROGRAMMER2024 – 2025Lead Programmer • Dennis Trucking Services (dts-logistics.tech)<p>Programmed PayrollController.php, ReplayCenter.jsx, Routes.jsx, live Mapbox GPS fleet tracking, and multi-role Admin/Staff portals.</p>FULL-STACK DEV2022 – 2024Opol Community College • BSIT Program<p>Built strong programming fundamentals in PHP, Java, web technologies, data structures, and relational databases.</p>BSIT STUDENT// MY WORK			<h2>My Featured Projects • Dennis Trucking Services</h2>		<img src=\"http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dts-logistics-preview.jpg\" alt=\"Dennis Trucking Services Live Preview\"> DTS-LOGISTICS.TECHLIVE TRACKING CODE<h3 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.12rem; font-weight:700; margin:4px 0 8px;\">DTS Live GPS Tracking &amp; Waybill Lookup</h3><p style=\"color:#64748B; font-size:13.8px; line-height:1.62; margin:0;\">Programmed the Mapbox GPS tracking feed, public waybill search (e.g. DTS-882104), live truck speed/coordinates telemetry, and Digital Photo e-POD module.</p><ul><li>Real-time GPS coordinates &amp; status API</li><li>Digital Photo Proof of Delivery (e-POD) upload</li></ul>LaravelReactMapbox GPS<a href=\"https://dts-logistics.tech\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Live on dts-logistics.tech </a><img src=\"http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dts-logistics-preview.jpg\" alt=\"Dennis Trucking Services Live Preview\"> DTS-LOGISTICS.TECHDISPATCH MODULES<h3 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.12rem; font-weight:700; margin:4px 0 8px;\">DTS Route Replay Center &amp; Fleet Console</h3><p style=\"color:#64748B; font-size:13.8px; line-height:1.62; margin:0;\">Built ReplayCenter.jsx, Routes.jsx, fleet estimator calculators, and dispatch monitoring dashboards handling live trip status across Mindanao &amp; Nationwide routes.</p><ul><li>Interactive historical trip ReplayCenter.jsx</li><li>Route management &amp; freight estimator controllers</li></ul>Inertia.jsReactTailwind CSS<a href=\"https://dts-logistics.tech\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Live on dts-logistics.tech </a><img src=\"http://professional-portfolio.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dts-logistics-preview.jpg\" alt=\"Dennis Trucking Services Live Preview\"> DTS-LOGISTICS.TECHPAYROLL ENGINE<h3 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.12rem; font-weight:700; margin:4px 0 8px;\">DTS Admin &amp; Office Staff Payroll System</h3><p style=\"color:#64748B; font-size:13.8px; line-height:1.62; margin:0;\">Engineered PayrollController.php alongside Admin/Payroll.jsx and OfficeStaff/Payroll.jsx to automate driver trip pay, deductions, and printable payslips.</p><ul><li>PayrollController.php calculation &amp; validation</li><li>Dual Admin &amp; Office Staff React payroll views</li></ul>PHP 8MySQLPayroll API<a href=\"https://dts-logistics.tech\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Live on dts-logistics.tech </a>// SAMPLE DELIVERABLES &amp; OUTPUTS			<h2>Role-Specific Outputs • PROGRAMMER</h2>		<p style=\"text-align:center; color:#64748B; font-size:15.5px; max-width:680px; margin:8px auto 12px;\">Concrete technical artifacts, workflows, and engineering outputs I produced for <strong>Dennis Trucking Services (dts-logistics.tech)</strong>.</p>CODE HIGHLIGHT 01<h3 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.12rem; font-weight:700; margin:4px 0 6px;\">Real-Time Mapbox GPS Polling &amp; Telemetry</h3><p style=\"color:#64748B; font-size:13.5px; line-height:1.58; margin:0;\">Live coordinate synchronization and historical trip playback engineered in ReplayCenter.jsx and Routes.jsx for dts-logistics.tech.</p>Routes &amp; Telemetry Sync (JS / Laravel)<pre style=\"margin:0; white-space:pre-wrap; font-family:inherit; background:transparent; color:inherit; padding:0; border:none;\">fetch(&#039;/api/fleet/live-telemetry&#039;)\n  .then(res =&gt; res.json())\n  .then(trucks =&gt; updateMapMarkers(trucks));\n// Tracks speed, heading &amp; GPS status live</pre><ul><li>Sub-second vehicle marker updates</li><li>Historical polyline route replay</li></ul>CODE HIGHLIGHT 02<h3 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.12rem; font-weight:700; margin:4px 0 6px;\">Waybill Lookup &amp; Digital e-POD API</h3><p style=\"color:#64748B; font-size:13.5px; line-height:1.58; margin:0;\">Instant shipment search (e.g. DTS-882104) with driver photo Proof of Delivery capture and status updates.</p>Waybill Status Validation (PHP 8)<pre style=\"margin:0; white-space:pre-wrap; font-family:inherit; background:transparent; color:inherit; padding:0; border:none;\">$waybill = Waybill::with(&#039;epodPhoto&#039;)\n  -&gt;where(&#039;tracking_no&#039;, $req-&gt;code)\n  -&gt;firstOrFail();\nreturn response()-&gt;json($waybill);</pre><ul><li>Public waybill lookup endpoint</li><li>Verified Digital Photo e-POD storage</li></ul>CODE HIGHLIGHT 03<h3 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.12rem; font-weight:700; margin:4px 0 6px;\">Automated Payroll Formula Engine</h3><p style=\"color:#64748B; font-size:13.5px; line-height:1.58; margin:0;\">Server-side calculation in PayrollController.php powering Admin/Payroll.jsx and OfficeStaff/Payroll.jsx.</p>PayrollController.php Computation<pre style=\"margin:0; white-space:pre-wrap; font-family:inherit; background:transparent; color:inherit; padding:0; border:none;\">$gross = ($trips * $rate) + $overtime;\n$netPay = $gross - ($sss + $philhealth + $ca);\nreturn Inertia::render(&#039;Admin/Payroll&#039;, compact(&#039;netPay&#039;));</pre><ul><li>Zero manual arithmetic errors</li><li>Printable payslips &amp; audit trail</li></ul>// CREDENTIALS &amp; TRAINING			<h2>Certifications, Trainings &amp; Seminars</h2>		2026Opol Community College • BSIT<h3 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.1rem; font-weight:700; margin:0 0 8px;\">Capstone Production Deployment Recognition</h3><p style=\"color:#64748B; font-size:13.8px; line-height:1.6; margin:0;\">Built and deployed Dennis Trucking Services (dts-logistics.tech) on Ubuntu Nginx VPS with HTTPS SSL.</p>2025Laravel &amp; Modern PHP Workshop<h3 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.1rem; font-weight:700; margin:0 0 8px;\">Full-Stack Web Engineering Certificate</h3><p style=\"color:#64748B; font-size:13.8px; line-height:1.6; margin:0;\">Hands-on training covering MVC controllers, Eloquent ORM, Inertia.js, React components, and API security.</p>2024Regional IT Student Tech Summit<h3 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.1rem; font-weight:700; margin:0 0 8px;\">Relational Database &amp; Git Workflow Seminar</h3><p style=\"color:#64748B; font-size:13.8px; line-height:1.6; margin:0;\">Completed practical modules on MySQL query indexing, branch protection, and collaborative code reviews.</p>// WHY HIRE ME &amp; DIGITAL CV			<h2>Why Hire Me &amp; 1-Page Digital Resume</h2>		WHY HIRE ME<h3 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.3rem; margin:2px 0 14px;\">What I Bring to Your Team</h3><strong style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:14.2px; display:block;\">Production-Proven Full-Stack Coder</strong>Already shipped a real-world live logistics system (dts-logistics.tech) with GPS tracking and payroll.<strong style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:14.2px; display:block;\">Clean MVC &amp; React/Inertia Architecture</strong>Writes maintainable, well-structured Laravel PHP backends and responsive React + Tailwind frontends.<strong style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:14.2px; display:block;\">Fast Debugger &amp; Server Ready</strong>Experienced with Laragon local environments, MySQL tuning, Ubuntu Nginx VPS, and SSL deployment.<strong style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:14.2px; display:block;\">Collaborative Team Player</strong>Translates System Analyst ERDs/DFDs and PM sprint goals directly into working software features.Connect Directly With Justin Maurin<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/share/1DqtmdqEuJ/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Facebook Profile</a><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/itz.me_tinay/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Instagram</a><h3 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.3rem; margin:0 0 2px;\">Justin B. Maurin</h3>Lead Programmer &amp; Software DeveloperBachelor of Science in Information Technology<strong style=\"color:#0F172A;\">occ.maurin.justin@gmail.com</strong>Mobile: 09301412288Birthday: August 17, 2003 &bull; Language: Bisaya<strong>Address:</strong> Igpit, Opol, Misamis Oriental &nbsp;|&nbsp; <strong>Birth Residence:</strong> NMMCFlagship Project Experience<p style=\"font-size:12.5px; color:#0F172A; line-height:1.5; margin:0 0 8px;\">Lead Programmer — Dennis Trucking Services (dts-logistics.tech) | Built PayrollController.php, ReplayCenter.jsx, Routes.jsx, Waybill Tracker &amp; e-POD modules.</p>Technical &amp; Core Competencies<p style=\"font-size:12.5px; color:#64748B; line-height:1.5; margin:0 0 8px;\">PHP 8.2, Laravel, Inertia.js, React.js, JavaScript (ES6+), MySQL, Tailwind CSS, Mapbox GPS API, Git/GitHub, Linux Nginx VPS</p>School Graduated<strong>Elementary:</strong> Igpit Elementary School (Graduation Year: 2016 &bull; Igpit, Opol, Misamis Oriental)<strong>High School:</strong> Opol National Secondary Technical School (Graduation Year: 2020 &bull; Opol, Misamis Oriental)<strong>Senior High School:</strong> Opol National Secondary Technical School (Graduation Year: 2022 &bull; Opol, Misamis Oriental)<strong>College:</strong> Opol Community College (Present &bull; Opol, Misamis Oriental)Recognitions &amp; Seminars<p style=\"font-size:12px; color:#0F172A; line-height:1.45; margin:0;\">Capstone Production Deployment Recognition (2026) • Full-Stack Web Engineering Certificate (2025) • Relational Database &amp; Git Workflow Seminar (2024)</p><button type=\"button\" onclick=\"window.print()\"> Print / Save 1-Page Resume as PDF</button>// CONTACT ME			<h2>Get In Touch With Justin Maurin</h2>		<h3 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.25rem; margin-bottom:14px;\">Direct Contact Info</h3><p style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">Interested in working with me on a project, OJT/internship, or technical collaboration? Reach me directly via Email, Mobile, Facebook, or Instagram.</p><strong style=\"color:#0F172A; display:block;\">Email Address</strong><a href=\"mailto:occ.maurin.justin@gmail.com\" style=\"color:#F97316; font-weight:600; text-decoration:none;\">occ.maurin.justin@gmail.com</a><strong style=\"color:#0F172A; display:block;\">Mobile Number</strong><a href=\"tel:09301412288\" style=\"color:#0F172A; text-decoration:none;\">09301412288</a><strong style=\"color:#0F172A; display:block;\">Location</strong>Igpit, Opol, Misamis Oriental<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/share/1DqtmdqEuJ/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Justin B. Maurin (Facebook)\"></a><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/itz.me_tinay/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"@itz.me_tinay (Instagram)\"></a><a href=\"mailto:occ.maurin.justin@gmail.com\" title=\"Email Justin B. Maurin\"></a><a href=\"tel:09301412288\" title=\"Call 09301412288\"></a><h3 style=\"color:#0F172A; font-size:1.25rem; margin-bottom:14px;\">Message Justin Maurin</h3><form onsubmit=\"event.preventDefault(); var msg=this.querySelector(\'.tp-sent-msg\'); msg.style.display=\'block\'; this.reset();\"><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Your Name\" required><input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Your Email Address\" required><textarea rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"Write your message for Justin Maurin...\" required></textarea><button type=\"submit\">Send to Justin Maurin →</button><p style=\"display:none; color:#15803D; font-weight:600; font-size:13.5px;